{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-one-b-tower","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"one-b-tower-wasl-business-bay","about":"ONE B Tower at Sheikh Zayed Road, Dubai is a groundbreaking initiative launched by His Highness Sheikh Mohammed bin Rashid Al Maktoum,Vice President and Prime Minister of the United Arab Emirates and Ruler of Dubai. Developed by Wasl, One B Tower combines world-class craftsmanship with contemporary aesthetics, offering an exclusive collection of 1 to 4-bedroom apartments, duplexes, and penthouses. Strategically located on Sheikh Zayed Road in Business Bay, this 47-story architectural marvel offers breathtaking views of the Dubai Water Canal, Safa Park, and the city’s skyline. Beyond its luxurious living spaces, One B Tower serves a greater purpose, supporting the 1 Billion Meals Endowment Programme in partnership with the Mohammed bin Rashid Al Maktoum Global Initiatives. One B Tower by Wasl Properties at Sheikh Zayed Road is more than just a premium residential address; it is a beacon of humanitarian efforts, with all proceeds dedicated to expanding the fund value to AED 1 billion.","price":2400000,"title":"One B Tower","bitrix":{"id":912,"pf_id":"are.2.13890","source":null,"project_id":"One B Tower","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"One B Tower","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Wasl Properties","project_location":"Business Bay"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/One_B_Tower_by_Wasl_Properties_at_Sheikh_Zayed_Road_84a11f3c80.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/One_B_Tower_by_Wasl_Properties_at_Sheikh_Zayed_Road_84a11f3c80.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0274693,"lng":54.9433721},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/One_B_Tower_by_Wasl_Properties_at_Sheikh_Zayed_Road_cfe32b139e.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr